      "id": "t-sandbox",
      "type": "template",
      "title": "Windows 沙箱写文件被拒的排查骨架",
      "body": "先用 skill diagnose-windows-sandbox-acl 跑一遍，确认是 ACL 问题还是预期的沙箱限制；再决定是否用 workspace-write 重试。",
      "tags": ["windows", "sandbox", "acl"],
      "hits": 4,
